{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39912","headline":"茘枝二首 一 · 徐夤","name":"茘枝二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱弹星丸粲日光，绿琼枝散小香囊。\n龙绡壳绽红纹粟，鱼目珠涵白膜浆。\n梅熟已过南岭雨，橘酸空待洞庭霜。\n蛮山蹋晓和烟摘，拜捧金盘奉越王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}